Synthetic Dataset License — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

The synthetic manufacturing / supply-chain dataset in this directory
(relational tables, document corpus, evaluation questions, and gold paths) is
licensed under CC BY 4.0. You are free to share and adapt the material for any
purpose, provided that appropriate credit is given.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Please cite the accompanying paper:

  Youngjune Kang, Jaehyung Yoon, Chae Eun Youn, Kyungeun Kim, and Youngjae Kim.
  QFuse: Preserving Precise Queryability in Knowledge Graphs over Structured
  and Unstructured Data.

Note: This dataset is fully synthetic and modeled on the structure of the
Walmart M5 forecasting dataset. It contains no real customer, supplier, or
proprietary business data.
